# Copy this to .env and fill in the value. .env is git ignored and must never be committed.
#
# You only need a key to re-run the review, either from the command line or from the
# button on the local site. Reading the recorded review and reproducing every number in
# CHANGELOG.md needs no key at all, because the model responses are committed under cache/.
#
# Get one from https://aistudio.google.com. Note that the free tier allows twenty requests
# per day per model, which is not enough to complete a run; billing must be enabled.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
